title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 6;
card-image: img/sangerbund.jpg
#subtitle: Setting the direction for our newspapers and radio.

= Media

The SPD runs a sizeable media empire, with many newspapers throughout every German city and region. We could use the media for various purposes...

- @commercial
- @campaign
- @social_media
- @social_media_2
- @return: We should not do anything with media at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@commercial
title: Make our newspapers more commercialized by broadening their appeal beyond party supporters.
subtitle: This might upset ideological purists, but it may bring in more funds and perhaps expose the middle class to socialist views.
on-arrival: resources += 1; commercialized_media += 1; new_middle_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 10

Our commercialized newspapers are able to bring in more funds. However, the left and progressive factions express their displeasure.

@campaign
title: The purpose of our media is to elect more Social Democrats.
subtitle: Our newspapers will focus on the electoral campaign.
on-arrival: campaign_media += 1; workers_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent);

Our campaign media is mostly reaching the workers who are already satisfied with the SPDs course, but it must be doing *something*, or at least that is what we hope.

@social_media
title: We need to expand our appeal with the youth, create a social media team.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio = 0
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); catholics_spd += 4*(1 - dissent);

Our new social media team allows us to connect to young people in a more intimate setting than before, promoting the SPD with debates and other popular content. Since older generations are not interested in social media as much, we are reaching primarily young and educated voters, a fact of which our conservative wing is painfully aware of.

@social_media_2
title: Expand our social media team.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 0
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); catholics_spd += 4*(1 - dissent);

Our new social media team allows us to connect to young people in a more intimate setting than before, promoting the SPD with debates and other popular content. Since older generations are not interested in social media as much, we are reaching primarily young and educated voters, a fact of which our conservative wing is painfully aware of.